# Confidential storage tier: fetched submissions, feedback, evaluations.
# Declared as `storage.confidential` in activity.yaml, so `mostidy course
# feedback fetch` writes FERPA-protected student work here. Nothing was
# ignoring it, and this repository is on GitHub.
